fied","verificationNotes":["The supplied name exactly matches the normalized official Steam name for the supplied App ID."],"research":{"steam":{"status":"success","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T11:10:08.928Z","error":null}},"steamMetadata":{"appId":"740130","links":{"store":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/740130/","officialWebsite":null,"support":"https://www.bandainamcoent.com/support"},"storageRequirements":{"kind":"required_free_space","windows":{"minimum":{"value":45,"unit":"GB","display":"45 GB","approximateBytes":45000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 45 GB"},"recommended":{"value":45,"unit":"GB","display":"45 GB","approximateBytes":45000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 45 GB"}},"macos":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"linux":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"note":"Steam publishes required free space, not the exact installed or download size."},"controllerSupport":{"level":"full","xboxCompatible":null,"xboxEvidence":null,"note":"Generic Steam controller support does not prove Xbox controller compatibility."},"playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"onlineCoop":false,"localCoop":false,"lanCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"pvp":false,"maximumPlayers":null,"maximumPlayersNote":"The public Steam app-details response does not provide a reliable exact player limit.","evidence":["Single-player"]},"genres":["Action","RPG"],"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":28,"description":"Full controller support"},{"id":29,"description":"Steam Trading Cards"},{"id":55,"description":"DualShock Controller Support"},{"id":56,"description":"DualShock Controller Support"},{"id":57,"description":"DualSense Controller Support"},{"id":58,"description":"DualSense Controller Support"},{"id":59,"description":"Steam Input API Support"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"740130","steamName":"Tales of ARISE","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/740130/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T09:42:27.326668+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"300 years of tyranny. A mysterious mask. Lost pain and memories. Wield the Blazing Sword and join a mysterious, untouchable girl to fight your oppressors. Experience a tale of liberation, featuring characters with next-gen graphical expressiveness!","detailedDescription":"Beyond the Dawn Edition\n\nThe Beyond the Dawn Edition includes:\n• Tales of ARISE\n• Additional scenario \"Beyond the Dawn\"\n• Additional costumes & items\n\nFor 300 years, Rena has ruled over Dahna, pillaging the planet of its resources and stripping people of their dignity and freedom.\nOur tale begins with two people, born on different worlds, each looking to change their fate and create a new future.\nFeaturing a diverse cast of characters, an intuitive and rewarding combat system, and a captivating story set in a lush world worth fighting for, Tales of Arise delivers a first-class JRPG experience.\n\nBEYOND THE DAWN\nAfter the battle for the fate of two worlds, Alphen and his party meet a young girl named Nazamil, who is the daughter of a Renan Lord and a Dahnan. Will the six be able to change the fate of the girl who will eventually fall under the curse of the mask? Explore the world again with party members who are bound together by a strong bond.\n\nBeyond the Dawn contents:\n- Additional scenario \"Beyond the Dawn\"\nSatisfying storyline, new dungeons, and subquests that depict the new adventures of the party members.\n- Special Data\n6 additional costumes, content featuring the hero and heroine, and more.\n- Travel Support Pack\nAdditional items (50,000 Gald, Level Up +5, CP +100, complete fishing gear).\n- Silver Weapon Collection\nA set of new silver-colored variant weapons.\n\n*Beyond the Dawn content will be available in-game after claiming it from the Unclaimed DLC List.\n*Content included in this product can be purchased separately.\n*A Premium Edition is also available. Please be careful not to purchase the same content twice.\n\nBeyond the Dawn Premium Edition\n\nWield the Blazing Sword and join a mysterious, untouchable girl to fight your oppressors.\n\nThe Beyond the Dawn Premium Edition includes:\n• Tales of ARISE\n• Additional scenario \"Beyond the Dawn\"\n• Classic Characters Costume & Arranged BGM Pack\n• Premium Travel Pack\n• Starter Pack\n• Premium Item/Premium Costume Packs\n• Additional Costumes & Items\n\nAbout the Game\n\nA world of nature drawn with the “Atmospheric Shader”\nWe are introducing a new graphics shader, inspired by anime and watercolor painting. Characters with attractive designs travel among backgrounds filled with beautiful and delicate visuals.\n\nExplore a world that feels alive\nExplore the world of Dahna, where a mix of unique, natural environments change in appearance based on the time of day. Climb over the rocky terrain, swim in rivers, gather around the campfire, cook food, head to the next town, defeat the master of an alien planet, and liberate the people!\n\nStylish action and battles\nThrough the new system “Boost Strike”, you can now chain combos of powerful attacks together with your party members. Chain Artes, Boost Attacks, and Boost Strike combos to take down your enemies!\n\nExperience the story of the divided Renan and Dahnan people\nThe protagonists who will determine the fate of these two worlds are Alphen and Shionne. They will overcome hardships and grow together with their unique group of friends. Gorgeous animation by ufotable is inserted at key points in the story, adding more color to our protagonists’ journey.","aboutGame":"A world of nature drawn with the “Atmospheric Shader”\nWe are introducing a new graphics shader, inspired by anime and watercolor painting. Characters with attractive designs travel among backgrounds filled with beautiful and delicate visuals.\n\nExplore a world that feels alive\nExplore the world of Dahna, where a mix of unique, natural environments change in appearance based on the time of day. Climb over the rocky terrain, swim in rivers, gather around the campfire, cook food, head to the next town, defeat the master of an alien planet, and liberate the people!\n\nStylish action and battles\nThrough the new system “Boost Strike”, you can now chain combos of powerful attacks together with your party members. Chain Artes, Boost Attacks, and Boost Strike combos to take down your enemies!\n\nExperience the story of the divided Renan and Dahnan people\nThe protagonists who will determine the fate of these two worlds are Alphen and Shionne. They will overcome hardships and grow together with their unique group of friends. Gorgeous animation by ufotable is inserted at key points in the story, adding more color to our protagonists’ journey."},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740130/9031a1f4e34e8031118594726762d7979e43f320/header.jpg?t=1783413316"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740130/3c17579d4d76ad1cb7a40c5402a99da0fb478e91/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783413316"},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740130/extras/3152b82f835ede343ce5976cd79e57dd.avif?t=1783413316","alt":""}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740130/ss_ff3e713e134572734fdc55adcb6043e2652f0506.600x338.jpg?t=1783413316","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740130/ss_ff3e713e134572734fdc55adcb6043e2652f0506.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783413316"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/740130/ss_3ca8447106ddb23b14e4e30db0b24cbb35